    title: "IRGC chief says Iran's air space 'red line' for armed forces",
    summary: "IRGC chief says Iran's air space 'red line' for armed forces Commander-in-Chief of the Islamic Revolutionary Guards Corps (IRGC) Major General Ahmad Vahidi has said that Iran’s airspace is a red line for the country's armed forces and any breach will be met with a \"firm and decisive response\", Mehr news agency reported. On Saturday, Major General Vahidi visited Iran's underground missile city for the first time as the force unveiled a new dual-missile launcher. During his visit, Vahidi said that \"events unfolding for the enemy were only the beginning\" and that \"the enemy would witness humiliation and defeat and that truth would prevail over falsehood\", according to Mehr.",
